  "description": "When Seong-ju, who is much older than Lee Hyun, receives a confession from him, he rejects him, saying he isn’t gay and that there’s a big age gap between them. As time passes, Seong-ju reaches his late twenties and is still a lifelong bachelor... But after spending a rather disheartening birthday, Lee Hyun shows up with a bouquet of roses. \n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**     \n[MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000052724), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12253649), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/true_love_kiss)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://honto.jp/ebook/pd-series_C-MBJ-21782-0-608900X.html)",
